@startuml TemplateGeneration
title Create, check, and reuse a template
autonumber
actor User
participant Application as App
participant Domain
participant Model
participant MCP

User -> App: Prompt and easy/medium/hard difficulty
App -> Domain: Get instructions and schema
App -> MCP: Get tools tagged for this domain once
App -> Model: Request proposal and selected checks
Model --> App: Proposal and check plan

loop Until success, at most 3 attempts
    App -> Domain: Build candidate
    loop Selected checks
        App -> Model: Request tool calls
        Model --> App: Tool names and arguments
        App -> MCP: Call with current candidate
        MCP -> MCP: Run checking operation
        MCP --> App: Results
        App -> Model: Return results
    end
    alt All checks passed
        App -> Model: Final results; acknowledgement only
        App -> Domain: Package checked answers and distractors
        Domain --> App: Artifact, or missing required data
        App -> App: checked, or needs_review if data is missing
    else Failed and attempts remain
        App -> Model: Request revision using all results
        Model --> App: Revised proposal, same selected checks
    else Third attempt failed
        App -> Model: Final results; acknowledgement only
        App -> App: needs_review
    end
end
App --> User: One report with all attempts; small artifact if available

note over App, User
Saved artifacts get a new ID.
Reports keep history; artifacts keep content and checked answers.
Existing-candidate validation checks once without revisions.
Interrupted conversations return error.
Human approval is future product work.
end note

User -> App: Saved artifact and seed
App -> Domain: Generate question locally
Domain --> App: Question
App --> User: Question; no model or MCP calls
@enduml
